  "title": "Bigrand Ranger 1# Try PVE M+",
  "description": "[overview]\nSpec Overview: \nFirst of all you had to get a good Polearm, pref with any on hit effect.\nSecond, after you get any Hit/Expertise soft cap you should go for Crit on every slot.\n\nRotation: \n-ST prio on every DoT >> Dirty Blades >> Armor Debuff >> Assault(@20%HP) >> Skullpiercer ( 5 Advantage ) --> use what quiver you like most prob the Phisical one is the best\n\n-AOE DoT on main target >> Quills ( any Advantage )  --> use poison quiver",
