   "body": "I wrote this guide while I'm @40 so idk if i miss any spell\nUsually I open with:\nStealth -> Poison Dot -> Ravage -> Serrated Shot -> Build Adv -> Dirty Blades \n\nFor the use of Quill I assume under 5 target use it only to spread the dot",
